{"seq":3,"slug":"demand-rebalancing","title":"按需求预测动态再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-inventory-sync-platform/allocation-rebalance/demand-rebalancing","wordCount":2673,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"按需求预测动态再平衡\">按需求预测动态再平衡</h1><p>前两篇给了静态答案：安全库存算出每个区域留多少，调拨给出货如何移动。但需求不静态——某个市场突然起量、某个渠道被平台限流、某个区域因为一场赛事而爆单，静态参数会在数周内变得明显失配。动态再平衡要做的，是把前两篇的参数与决策接进一个随时间滚动的闭环：预测变了，安全库存跟着变，再平衡阈值跟着变，调拨建议跟着变，而每一次变化都要能承受预测本身的不确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>再平衡（rebalancing）与补货（replenishment）是两件事，区分它们能避免大量混淆。补货是<strong>纵向</strong>的：把货从上游供应链补充到销售网络，触发依据是库存低于再订货点。再平衡是<strong>横向</strong>的：在网络内部把货从富余节点移到短缺节点，触发依据是节点之间的库存失衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[历史销量 + 在途 + 库存] --&gt; B[需求预测]&#10;    B --&gt; C[区域需求分布]&#10;    C --&gt; D[安全库存重算]&#10;    C --&gt; E[失衡检测]&#10;    F[各仓当前库存] --&gt; E&#10;    G[在途库存] --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; H{失衡超过阈值?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[保持]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[生成再平衡建议]&#10;    J --&gt; K[成本收益评估]&#10;    K --&gt; L{通过?}&#10;    L --&gt;|是| M[创建调拨单]&#10;    L --&gt;|否| I&#10;    M --&gt; N[执行反馈]&#10;    N --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[历史销量 + 在途 + 库存] --&gt; B[需求预测]\n    B --&gt; C[区域需求分布]\n    C --&gt; D[安全库存重算]\n    C --&gt; E[失衡检测]\n    F[各仓当前库存] --&gt; E\n    G[在途库存] --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; H{失衡超过阈值?}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[保持]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[生成再平衡建议]\n    J --&gt; K[成本收益评估]\n    K --&gt; L{通过?}\n    L --&gt;|是| M[创建调拨单]\n    L --&gt;|否| I\n    M --&gt; N[执行反馈]\n    N --&gt; A</pre><p>这个闭环里最容易出问题的一环是<strong>反馈延迟</strong>：预测变了，安全库存重算了，调拨也发了，但货要 5 到 20 天才能到。等货到时需求可能又变了，于是新的失衡产生，系统开始永不停歇地搬货。这就是再平衡系统最典型的失效模式——<strong>震荡</strong>（oscillation）。抑制震荡是动态再平衡的核心工程问题，各种机制都是在回答「如何让系统对噪声不敏感但对真实趋势敏感」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测在再平衡中的正确用法\">预测在再平衡中的正确用法</h2><p>再平衡需要的预测精度与需求计划需要的完全不同。需求计划关心的是「下个季度卖多少」，需要绝对精度；再平衡关心的是<strong>相对失衡</strong>——哪个区域的预测上调幅度显著大于其他区域。这个区别有重要的实践含义：再平衡对<strong>系统性偏差</strong>不敏感，对<strong>相对变化</strong>敏感。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>imbalance</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>w</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msup><mi>w</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></munder><msub><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>w</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{imbalance}_{w} = \\frac{\\hat{D}_w}{\\sum_{w&#x27;} \\hat{D}_{w&#x27;}} - \\frac{h_w}{\\sum_{w&#x27;} h_{w&#x27;}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">imbalance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7603em;vertical-align:-1.1365em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6238em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1632em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1783em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.328em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1365em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3571em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1783em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.328em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中第一项是区域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的预测需求占比，第二项是它的库存占比。这个差值度量的是「需求占比」与「库存占比」的偏离。它的好处是<strong>自动免疫全局偏差</strong>：如果所有区域的预测都被高估了 20%，两项占比都不变，失衡指标仍然是 0，系统不会因此乱搬货。这正是一个好的失衡指标应有的性质。</p>\n<p>预测的时间尺度要与调拨提前期匹配。如果跨国调拨需要 3 周，那么用未来 1 周的预测来触发调拨是错的——货到时的需求早已不是预测的那个。正确做法是用<strong>提前期结束时的预测</strong>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t + L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的需求预测）作为触发依据。这个看似显然的规则在实践中经常被违反，因为「下个月的预测」在系统里可能还没生成，或者当天的库存报表用的是当天预测，两者不自觉地混用了。</p>\n<p>预测不确定性的量化不可省略。同一个预测值，置信区间宽的和窄的应该有不同的行动阈值：预测上调 30% 但置信区间宽到 ±50%，说明这次上调可能是噪声，应该等待观察或只做小规模试探；预测上调 30% 且置信区间 ±8%，说明是真实趋势，可以放心调拨。因此再平衡阈值应该是<strong>预测变化的信噪比</strong>而不是变化幅度本身：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>signal</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>w</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>w</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mtext>forecast_error</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{signal} = \\frac{|\\hat{D}_w^{(t)} - \\hat{D}_w^{(t-1)}|}{\\sigma_{\\text{forecast\\_error}, w}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">signal</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7748em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7218em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3588em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">forecast_error</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2748em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7218em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母是历史预测误差的标准差，它起的作用与统计检验里的标准误相同。这个比值让不同波动水平的 SKU 有了可比的触发标准：高波动 SKU 需要更大的预测变化才会触发调拨，低波动 SKU 的小变化就足以触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补货点与再平衡阈值的联动\">补货点与再平衡阈值的联动</h2><p>补货点和再平衡阈值必须联动重算，否则两者会在边界上互相打架。想象一个场景：区域 A 的库存降到再订货点以下，补货单已发出但货要 6 周到；如果在补货单已发的状态下，再平衡系统又从区域 A 调走一批货给区域 B，那么 A 的断货风险被放大——它的补货已经在路上，但它失去了最后一点缓冲。</p>\n<p>处理方式是在再平衡的可用量计算中<strong>扣除已承诺的补货与已承诺的外调</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mtext>available for rebalance</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>pending</mtext></munder><msub><mtext>inbound</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>promised</mtext><mrow><mtext>out</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{available for rebalance}, w} = h_w - SS_w - \\sum_{\\text{pending}} \\text{inbound}_w - \\text{promised}_{\\text{out}, w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">available for rebalance</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pending</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inbound</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">promised</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该区域的安全库存底线——<strong>安全库存是再平衡的不可动部分</strong>。这个约束把两篇连起来：安全库存定义「留多少」，再平衡只能在底线之上动货。把这层关系显式写进计算，而不是让两个系统各自算各自的，是避免「补货与调拨互相抵消」的关键。</p>\n<p>联动还体现在<strong>阈值的不对称</strong>上。触发再平衡的失衡阈值应当高于阻止再平衡的界限（后者更宽松），形成迟滞（hysteresis）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>trigger</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{trigger}} &gt; \\theta_{\\text{stop}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trigger</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>迟滞的作用是防止系统在阈值附近来回抖动——失衡到 5% 触发调拨，货走了一点失衡降到 4.9%，如果 4.9% 又低于某个「恢复」阈值就停止，系统会在边界上反复启停。给触发和停止设不同的阈值，让系统在跨过触发线后必须显著改善才停手，这能大幅降低无效调拨次数。这个技巧与渠道封顶的「收紧即时、放宽滞后」是同一类设计（见 <a href=\"../sync-consistency/sync-lag-oversell\">同步延迟导致的跨平台超卖</a>），其原型是 TCP 拥塞控制的 AIMD：检测到丢包立即减半、无拥塞时每 RTT 线性加一，形成「快速后退、缓慢恢复」的迟滞式调节（来源：RFC 5681, <a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）。\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5681）。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>调大的后果</th>\n<th>调小的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>trigger</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{trigger}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trigger</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>何时启动再平衡</td>\n<td>响应迟钝、失衡持续</td>\n<td>频繁调拨、成本上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停止阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{stop}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>何时停手</td>\n<td>一次调拨过多</td>\n<td>边界抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信噪比门槛</td>\n<td>预测变化是否可信</td>\n<td>漏掉真实趋势</td>\n<td>追噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确认窗口</td>\n<td>触发前需持续的时长</td>\n<td>响应变慢</td>\n<td>被瞬时尖峰触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小调拨量</td>\n<td>单次调拨的下限</td>\n<td>小失衡不处理</td>\n<td>调拨成本被摊薄不足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得展开：<strong>最小调拨量</strong>是一个纯粹的经济性参数。运一箱货和运一百箱货的单证与操作成本几乎相同，因此调拨量必须超过一个规模门槛才划算。这导致小失衡被系统性地忽略——这是正确的取舍，但需要在监控上可见，否则运营会以为系统漏掉了这些失衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"震荡的抑制与验证\">震荡的抑制与验证</h2><p>再平衡系统的震荡有明确的诊断特征：同一对仓之间的调拨在数周内方向反复，或者某个 SKU 的调拨记录数量远超其销量。检测方式是比较<strong>净流动量</strong>与<strong>总流动量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>transfer</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>transfer</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>transfer</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{churn}} = \\frac{\\sum |\\text{transfer}_i| - \\left|\\sum \\text{transfer}_i\\right|}{\\sum |\\text{transfer}_i|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transfer</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transfer</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transfer</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{churn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0 说明货是单向流动的（健康），接近 1 说明来回搬运（震荡）。这个指标可以按 SKU、按仓对、按时间窗口计算，是诊断再平衡质量最直接的量。它同时也是一个很好的成本指标——震荡搬运的成本是纯粹的浪费。</p>\n<p>抑制震荡的手段有三个层次。<strong>来源层</strong>：降低触发频率（确认窗口、信噪比门槛），让系统只在趋势确认后行动。<strong>决策层</strong>：在建议生成时考虑在途（一笔在途调拨已经会改变目的仓的库存，不应再触发第二笔），并对同一仓对设置冷却期。<strong>执行层</strong>：对已经发出的调拨允许取消，但只允许在拣货前取消（见 <a href=\"inter-warehouse-transfer\">跨仓/跨国调拨与在途库存</a>），这提供了一个低成本的纠错窗口。</p>\n<p>验证再平衡系统是否有效，需要一个不依赖预测的对照。常用的方法是<strong>回测</strong>：拿历史库存快照与历史需求，模拟「如果当时执行了再平衡建议」与「如果完全不执行」两种情形下的服务水平与总成本，比较两者。回测的价值在于它能暴露阈值的敏感性——如果阈值微调就让回测结果大幅变化，说明参数处在不稳定区域，上线后必然会震荡。回测也能量化「再平衡的净收益」，这是让供应链管理层接受这套系统的唯一有说服力的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>再平衡是<strong>横向</strong>的（网络内节点间平衡），补货是<strong>纵向</strong>的（从上游补入），两者触发依据不同但必须联动。</li>\n<li>再平衡最典型的失效模式是<strong>震荡</strong>；证书指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{churn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 度量净流动与总流动之比，接近 0 健康、接近 1 是来回搬运。</li>\n<li>失衡指标应该用<strong>占比之差</strong>（需求占比 − 库存占比），这样自动免疫全局预测偏差，只对相对变化敏感。</li>\n<li>预测尺度必须与调拨提前期匹配：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的预测触发，而不是当前时刻的预测。</li>\n<li>触发阈值应是<strong>信噪比</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>error</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta \\hat{D}| / \\sigma_{\\text{error}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">error</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而不是变化幅度，让不同波动水平的 SKU 有可比标准。</li>\n<li>再平衡的可用量必须扣除在途补货与已承诺外调，且<strong>安全库存是不可动底线</strong>，这是与 <a href=\"safety-stock-region\">分区域安全库存模型</a> 的接口。</li>\n<li>触发阈值与停止阈值必须不对称（迟滞），防止边界抖动；调大触发阈值牺牲响应换稳定，调小则相反。</li>\n<li>最小调拨量是经济性参数，小失衡被系统性忽略是正确的取舍，但必须在监控上可见。</li>\n<li>抑制震荡分层：来源层（确认窗口、信噪比门槛）、决策层（考虑在途、冷却期）、执行层（拣货前可取消）。</li>\n<li>验证靠<strong>回测</strong>对照无再平衡的基线，同时检验阈值敏感性——微调即大幅变化的参数在上线后必然震荡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按需求预测动态再平衡","id":"按需求预测动态再平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预测在再平衡中的正确用法","id":"预测在再平衡中的正确用法"},{"level":2,"text":"补货点与再平衡阈值的联动","id":"补货点与再平衡阈值的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"震荡的抑制与验证","id":"震荡的抑制与验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨仓/跨国调拨与在途库存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-inventory-sync-platform/allocation-rebalance/inter-warehouse-transfer"},"next":{"title":"库存事件总线与下游订阅","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-inventory-sync-platform/sync-platform-ops/inventory-event-bus"}}